LICENSE
SECURITY.md
CLAUDE.md

# Native shells (Capacitor Android / iOS, Tauri desktop). The web image is
# built with `vite build` from `src/` and never reads them, while a dev box
# holds signing config (`android/keystore.properties`), copies of earlier web
# builds and the Rust `target/` dir (GBs) there. `COPY . .` would carry all of
# it into the runtime image.
apps/*/android
apps/*/ios
apps/*/src-tauri

# Infrastruktura buildu — kontekst nie potrzebuje siebie samego
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml

